  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Step into a piece of sneaker history with the adidas Handball Spezial. First designed in 1979 as a high-performance indoor sports shoes, this timeless classic has evolved into a streetwear essential loved for its clean lines, effortless style, and unmistakable retro attitude. This season’s women’s edition brings a fresh expression of the original silhouette, blending archival design with contemporary detailing. A soft suede upper, elevated with distinctive ruffle stripes, brings a feminine twist while staying true to its heritage roots. Signature Spezial branding, including the Trefoil tongue logo and a gold-foil Spezial name on the lateral side completes the look. A durable rubber outsole provides reliable grip for everyday wear, while the leather and textile upper and textile sockliner ensure long-lasting comfort. Celebrate decades of heritage with a feminine twist in the adidas Handball Spezial.</p> <p><strong>adidas Handball Spezial features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Suede upper with ruffle stripes delivers a vintage look.</li> <li>Leather and textile upper provides maximum comfort.</li> <li>Regular fit offers a relaxed feel.</li> <li>Laces ensure a snug fit.</li> <li>Textile sockliner adds a soft touch.</li> <li>Signature adidas Spezial Trefoil tongue logo elevates the style.</li> <li>Gold-foil Spezial name ensures a premium finish.</li> <li>Rubber outsole adds grip and durability.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Easy to style and comfortable enough for everyday wear, the adidas Handball Spezial brings retro indoor-sport roots into your daily rotation. Originally introduced in 1979, this women’s edition keeps the classic low-profile look with a soft suede upper, signature Spezial branding, and a gum rubber outsole that delivers timeless appeal.</p><ul><li>Soft suede upper with classic adidas detailing</li><li>Low-profile design rooted in Handball Spezial heritage</li><li>Lace-up closure for an adjustable fit</li><li>Textile sockliner adds a soft step-in feel</li><li>Gum rubber outsole provides durable traction</li></ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>For the best fit, we recommend going down a half size, as many shoppers say this pair feels a little roomy; if you prefer a slightly more relaxed fit, your usual adidas size may still work well.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for everyday casual wear, travel, and versatile outfits that move easily from jeans and joggers to dresses and business-casual looks.</p> <p><strong>Styling & Versatility</strong></p><p>Reviewers love how easily the Handball Spezial pairs with just about anything, giving it true go-to status for daily wear. The streamlined shape, suede build, and gum sole deliver an effortless vintage look that feels equally at home dressed up or kept casual.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p><p>Most reviewers say comfort shows up right away, with soft cushioning and supportive underfoot feel for long days on your feet. Some also call out the quality construction, while the suede upper and rubber outsole help keep the classic design ready for repeat wear.</p> <p><strong>Care & Maintenance</strong></p><p>Because this style features a suede upper, some shoppers recommend using a suede protector to help preserve the finish. Spot clean gently and avoid soaking to keep the texture looking its best.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas Originals Handball Spezial - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/White/Multi</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>KI2183</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">adidas Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Women's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official adidas shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 4.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 42.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 42.6<